# World of Warcraft Private Servers

Curated tracker of World of Warcraft private servers: current status for {{ servers.length }} servers, emulation history timeline, private-server news, and Classic+ (Project Camelot) development tracking. Last reviewed {{ site.reviewed }}. Not affiliated with Blizzard.

