## How to use this site as an AI

- For a quick overview, read this file and the Classic+ tracker.
- For full server data, fetch https://wowprivateservers.vercel.app/api/servers.json (108 rows: name, status, tag, popTier, url, updated, shutdown).
- For full news text, fetch https://wowprivateservers.vercel.app/api/news.json or https://wowprivateservers.vercel.app/llms-full.txt
- Every server has one page under /servers/{slug}/ — same data as the JSON, rendered as HTML.
- History is {{ history.length }} events (core emulators, tools, milestones) at https://wowprivateservers.vercel.app/#history — also in /llms-full.txt

